  "description": "Griffith College is an on-campus study option to achieve academic credit into hundreds of Griffith University degree majors, including 8-12 month Diploma’s which will transition students straight into their 2nd year of a range of University Bachelor degrees. Located within the Griffith University Southport (Gold Coast) and Mt Gravatt (Brisbane) Campuses, the College is embedded within the Griffith University community and offers students a great opportunity for entry to higher degree programs, with extra support and services available for each student to succeed. Griffith University is ranked in the top 2% of universities globally, enjoys research excellence, innovative teaching and learning practices, along with strong ties to industry.",
